<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company&#8217;s Articles of Incorporation, as amended, authorized the issuance of <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--PreferredStockSharesAuthorized_iI_c20260630__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesFPreferredStockMember_zhUksM78KuPk" title="Preferred stock, shares authorized"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesAuthorized" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_us-gaap_SeriesFPreferredStockMember" id="Fact000810" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">70,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
shares of Series F Preferred. <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--PreferredStockConversionBasis_c20260101__20260630__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesFPreferredStockMember_zjWgGb58M2fg" title="Preferred stock, conversion term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_us-gaap_SeriesFPreferredStockMember" id="Fact000812" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockConversionBasis">The
